Package: ramag
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Ramag Maintainers <tools-rs@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: ca-certificates, libc6, libdbus-1-3, libfontconfig1, libgcc-s1, libvulkan1, libwayland-client0, libxkbcommon0, xdg-utils
Recommends: git, openssh-client, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, gnome-keyring
Homepage: https://github.com/tools-rs/ramag
Description: Developer database, Git and SSH toolkit
 Ramag provides graphical database, version-control and SSH tools.
 Linux clipboard integration is intentionally not included.
